  "name": "lebanon-historical-baseline-openstreetmap-export",
  "notes": "Historical baseline for OSM buildings that includes buildings not modified or digitized after March 20 2025\r\n\r\nBuilding footprints across the region from OSM. Includes every feature tagged as a building (building=*), from residential homes through hospitals, schools, and places of worship. Useful for population estimation, damage assessment, and urban planning.\r\n\r\nOpenStreetMap is a free, collaborative world map built by volunteers. Completeness varies by region: urban areas are usually well-mapped, remote areas may be incomplete. Cross-check critical decisions with local field knowledge.\r\n\r\nSource: OpenStreetMap\r\nOSM tags: Key:building\r\nPart of many exports grid on HDX by the HOT",
